% Scenario: an immediately evaluated name whose value is local cannot be
% placed in a procedure being built in global VM.
% Expect: prints "/invalidaccess".
/v (local) def
true setglobal
{ ({ //v }) cvx exec } stopped pop
false setglobal
$error /errorname get ==
